{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Psychological Horror Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project Pastorate</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game built around exploration, tension, and environmental storytelling. Set in an isolated and unsettling location, the game focuses on atmosphere and unease rather than fast-paced action or combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players explore abandoned environments, uncover disturbing details, and piece together a narrative through subtle clues and surroundings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration-Driven Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay emphasizes slow exploration and observation. Progress comes from navigating environments, discovering hidden details, and interpreting the story as it unfolds organically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no complex mechanics or combat systems \u2014 the horror comes from isolation, uncertainty, and the environment itself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dark and Unsettling Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Pastorate relies on sound design, visual restraint, and pacing to create a persistent sense of dread. The experience is designed to be immersive and unsettling, appealing to fans of <strong>psychological and atmospheric horror</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>single-player horror experience</strong> intended for players who enjoy slow-burn tension and narrative discovery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person psychological horror gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration-focused progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling and narrative clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark, unsettling atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat \u2014 tension driven by mood and discovery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player immersive horror experience</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"4a453aea1a92d4e5a10724c38c486dbd95d7b43a.jpg","localized_name":"Ruthless","name":"Ruthless","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/811290/4a453aea1a92d4e5a10724c38c486dbd95d7b43a.jpg"},{"icon":"15915befdb7a285b8f6237a2f1f9f68e9e447dcd.jpg","localized_name":"Amateur bibliophile","name":"Amateur bibliophile","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/811290/15915befdb7a285b8f6237a2f1f9f68e9e447dcd.jpg"},{"icon":"621a1d21a08355a6c3d7be2631b574b4b704daa2.jpg","localized_name":"Slow down, I'm making notes ","name":"Slow down, I'm making notes ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/811290/621a1d21a08355a6c3d7be2631b574b4b704daa2.jpg"},{"icon":"749f32961d7d57952b32f965dfa53a650342d6dd.jpg","localized_name":"Erudite","name":"Erudite","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/811290/749f32961d7d57952b32f965dfa53a650342d6dd.jpg"},{"icon":"b5fb49d794c8c173e6bd7ee2cd9e585f1cdd47f7.jpg","localized_name":"Promotion ","name":"Promotion ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/811290/b5fb49d794c8c173e6bd7ee2cd9e585f1cdd47f7.jpg"},{"icon":"7b6f596b80b7209eacdcf2c9deb549eb43f4eff2.jpg","localized_name":"Merciful","name":"Merciful","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/811290/7b6f596b80b7209eacdcf2c9deb549eb43f4eff2.jpg"},{"icon":"7caf06eaf835c4693f3b94a6bad4ee32b3464c0f.jpg","localized_name":"Brawler","name":"Brawler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/811290/7caf06eaf835c4693f3b94a6bad4ee32b3464c0f.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/811290?t=1766172141","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/811290/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766172141","capsule_image":"https://shared.